   "index": "a1",
   "text": "Legend: grey hatched = out-of-date data \u00b7 colours: see the key above (always with a word) \u00b7 blue button = primary action \u00b7 dashed line on a phone = end of first screen \u00b7 dashed grey boxes = annotations \u00b7 problems use incident status, repairs use repair status (separate sets)",
   "originalText": "Legend: grey hatched = out-of-date data \u00b7 colours: see the key above (always with a word) \u00b7 blue button = primary action \u00b7 dashed line on a phone = end of first screen \u00b7 dashed grey boxes = annotations \u00b7 problems use incident status, repairs use repair status (separate sets)",
