   "index": "b4T",
   "text": "Every repair shows its repair-status steps (Waiting for approval \u2192\nRunning \u2192 Verifying \u2192 Succeeded / Failed) and who permitted it (FR-33,\nFR-34). Ticked repairs skip the approval step. Also Rejected, Blocked,\nCancelled, Expired. Notes such as \u201cundone\u201d or \u201cmade things worse\u201d sit\nnext to Failed (Amine). Placeholder data.",
